        <div class="irm-content">
            
            <div class="content-header">
                <div class="breadcrumb">
                    <a href="/">Home</a><span class="breadcrumb-sep">›</span><a href="/sam">SAM</a><span class="breadcrumb-sep">›</span><span>Process Simulator</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="content-title">SAM Pro <span class="gradient-text">Process Simulator</span></h1>
                <p class="content-subtitle">
                    Explore realistic sample records across 8 core SAM Pro tables. Click any record to expand its full ServiceNow-style form view, inspect choice dropdowns, examine foreign key reference tooltips, and follow the end-to-end licensing lifecycle.
                </p>
