            <section class="content-section" id="how-to-use">
                <h2>How to Use This Simulator</h2>
                <div class="info-card info-card--tip">
                    <div class="info-card-title">Interactive Guide</div>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Click any record</strong> to expand its two-column ServiceNow form view.
                        <strong>Choice fields</strong> (like Normalization Status, Lifecycle Phase, License Metric, Reclamation State) are rendered with realistic dropdowns.
                        <strong>Reference fields</strong> (like Software Model, Installed On CI, Entitlement) feature an interactive
                        <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.4);font-size:10px;color:#34d399;margin:0 2px;vertical-align:middle;">i</span>
                        info button — click it to see the underlying target table.
                        Tabs are ordered strictly by the <strong>closed-loop lifecycle flow</strong>: Raw Installations → Discovery Models → Software Models → Entitlements → Allocations → Reconciliation Results (ELP) → Reclamation Candidates → SaaS Subscriptions.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="content-section" id="simulator">
                <h2>Record Explorer</h2>
                <div class="sim-tabs-header" id="sim-tabs-header"></div>
                <div class="sim-tabs-content" id="sim-tabs-content"></div>
            </section>

